        {
          "path": ["documentation"],
          "value": {
            "description": "<p>実行者の movehit フラグを0へ戻します。実行後は <code>MoveContact</code>、<code>MoveGuarded</code>、<code>MoveHit</code> が0を返します。</p>",
            "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["movehitreset-local-2002", "movehitreset-local-1.0", "movehitreset-local-1.1"] }
          }
        },
        { "path": ["evidence"], "value": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["movehitreset-local-2002", "movehitreset-local-1.0", "movehitreset-local-1.1"], "comment": "2026-10-01: 保存済み公式資料で引数なしの movehit リセットと MoveContact / MoveGuarded / MoveHit の0を確認。MoveReversed への影響を確認済みとするものではない。" } },
        { "path": ["notes"], "value": [{ "kind": "research", "content": "<p>旧 description は Win版では <code>MoveReversed</code> も0にすると記録する。今回確認した公式3資料は MoveContact / MoveGuarded / MoveHit だけを挙げており、対象ビルドと実行ログがないため、旧文を原位置に保持して公開本文では断定しない。</p>", "evidence": { "status": "unverified", "basis": ["official_document", "source_code"], "source_refs": ["movehitreset-local-2002", "movehitreset-local-1.0", "movehitreset-local-1.1", "movehitreset-legacy-data"], "comment": "2026-10-01: 保存済み公式資料と旧 JSON の静的照合。MoveReversed の実機確認ではない。" } }] },
        { "path": ["quote", "-"], "value": { "id": "movehitreset-local-2002", "title": "MoveHitReset — 保存済み Elecbyte 2002.04.14 公式資料", "url": "/MUGEN/document/Official/2002.04.14/sctrls.html#MoveHitReset", "source_type": "official_document" } },
        { "path": ["quote", "-"], "value": { "id": "movehitreset-local-1.0", "title": "MoveHitReset — 保存済み Elecbyte 1.0 公式資料", "url": "/MUGEN/document/Official/1.0/sctrls.html#movehitreset", "source_type": "official_document" } },
        { "path": ["quote", "-"], "value": { "id": "movehitreset-local-1.1", "title": "MoveHitReset — 保存済み Elecbyte 1.1 公式資料", "url": "/MUGEN/document/Official/1.1b1/sctrls.html#movehitreset", "source_type": "official_document" } },
        { "path": ["quote", "-"], "value": { "id": "movehitreset-legacy-data", "title": "MoveHitReset — 移行前の説明原本", "url": "https://github.com/bluesura/bluesura.github.io/blob/426c438aecde152c2b6ae44a1f16015d468b658a/src/content/state-controllers/MoveHitReset.json", "source_type": "source_code" } }
